cff-version: 1.2.0
message: if you use windfold, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "windfold: wind-farm wake interactions learned from SCADA"
abstract: >-
  a Gaussian model of each turbine's power relative to its peers that keeps calibrated PyWake physics
  at the measured turbulence and learns one correction shared by every turbine pair in the wind's
  frame, with a benchmark of 23 models on four open SCADA datasets scored on wind-direction sectors
  held out from training.
